<title>USA: Titan Wheel converts 4.5 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Titan Wheel converts 4.5 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>QUINCY, Ill. 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Titan Wheel International Inc said Thursday on December 30, $56.6 million, or 66 percent of its 4-3/4 percent convertible subordinated notes due 2000, were converted into 4,530,240 shares at $12.50 per share.</p>
<p>It said $28.7 million, or 34 percent, of the notes were redeemed for cash.</p>
<p>The notes had an outstanding principle of $85.3 million.</p>
<p>Titan supplies mounted tire and wheel systems for off-highway vehicles.</p>
<p>	 ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
